        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "If 20% of the marbles in a box are blue and there are 34 blue marbles, how many marbles are there in the box?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "170 marbles",
          "worked": "20% represents 34 marbles.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Marbles represented by }10\\% &=34\\div2\\\\&=17\\\\\\text{Marbles represented by }100\\% &=17\\times10\\\\&=170\\end{align*}$$\n\nThere are 170 marbles in the box.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p9-q7-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "If 110% of an amount is $\\$220$, what was the original amount?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\$200$",
          "worked": "110% represents $\\$220$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Amount represented by }10\\% &=\\$220\\div11\\\\&=\\$20\\\\\\text{Amount represented by }100\\% &=\\$20\\times10\\\\&=\\$200\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe original amount was $\\$200$.",
